      "title": "What a task stores, and what is computed",
      "html": "<figure role='img' aria-label='Task states. Todo, blocked, complete and cancelled are stored. Active is computed from a pushed task branch. Blocking needs a reason, owner and revisit event; completing needs the acceptance block; cancelling and reopening need a reason.' style='margin:0'><svg viewBox='0 0 1000 372' style='width:100%;height:auto;display:block' fill='none'><defs><marker id='ar' viewBox='0 0 10 10' refX='9' refY='5' markerWidth='7' markerHeight='7' orient='auto-start-reverse'><path d='M0 0 L10 5 L0 10 Z' fill='var(--cf-diagram-line)'></path></marker><marker id='ag' viewBox='0 0 10 10' refX='9' refY='5' markerWidth='7' markerHeight='7' orient='auto-start-reverse'><path d='M0 0 L10 5 L0 10 Z' fill='var(--cf-accent)'></path></marker></defs><rect x='40' y='150' width='170' height='58' rx='10' fill='var(--cf-surface)' stroke='var(--cf-border-strong)' stroke-width='1.5'></rect><text x='125' y='185' fill='var(--cf-text)' font-size='15' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='600' style='font-family:var(--cf-font-mono)'>todo</text><rect x='420' y='150' width='170' height='58' rx='10' fill='var(--cf-surface)' stroke='var(--cf-border-strong)' stroke-width='1.5' stroke-dasharray='5 4'></rect><text x='505' y='178' fill='var(--cf-text)' font-size='15' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='600' style='font-family:var(--cf-font-mono)'>active</text><text x='505' y='197' fill='var(--cf-text-muted)' font-size='12' text-anchor='middle'>computed: branch pushed</text><rect x='420' y='24' width='170' height='58' rx='10' fill='var(--cf-surface)' stroke='var(--cf-border-strong)' stroke-width='1.5'></rect><text x='505' y='59' fill='var(--cf-text)' font-size='15' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='600' style='font-family:var(--cf-font-mono)'>blocked</text><rect x='800' y='150' width='170' height='58' rx='10' fill='var(--cf-accent-soft)' stroke='var(--cf-accent)' stroke-width='1.5'></rect><text x='885' y='185' fill='var(--cf-text)' font-size='15' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='600' style='font-family:var(--cf-font-mono)'>complete</text><rect x='420' y='278' width='170' height='58' rx='10' fill='var(--cf-surface)' stroke='var(--cf-border-strong)' stroke-width='1.5'></rect><text x='505' y='313' fill='var(--cf-text)' font-size='15' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='600' style='font-family:var(--cf-font-mono)'>cancelled</text><text x='125' y='230' fill='var(--cf-text-muted)' font-size='12' text-anchor='middle'>shown as ready or waiting,</text><text x='125' y='246' fill='var(--cf-text-muted)' font-size='12' text-anchor='middle'>computed from dependencies</text><line x1='210' y1='179' x2='418' y2='179' stroke='var(--cf-diagram-line)' stroke-width='1.5' marker-end='url(#ar)'></line><text x='314' y='170' fill='var(--cf-text)' font-size='12.5' text-anchor='middle'>claim: push task branch</text><line x1='590' y1='179' x2='798' y2='179' stroke='var(--cf-accent)' stroke-width='2' marker-end='url(#ag)'></line><text x='694' y='162' fill='var(--cf-text)' font-size='12.5' text-anchor='middle'>complete: needs the</text><text x='694' y='200' fill='var(--cf-text)' font-size='12.5' text-anchor='middle'>acceptance block</text><line x1='505' y1='150' x2='505' y2='84' stroke='var(--cf-diagram-line)' stroke-width='1.5' marker-end='url(#ar)'></line><text x='516' y='120' fill='var(--cf-text)' font-size='12.5' text-anchor='start'>block: reason, owner, revisit</text><path d='M420,53 L125,53 L125,148' stroke='var(--cf-diagram-line)' stroke-width='1.5' fill='none' marker-end='url(#ar)'></path><text x='272' y='45' fill='var(--cf-text)' font-size='12.5' text-anchor='middle'>unblock</text><path d='M125,208 L125,258 L125,307 L418,307' stroke='var(--cf-diagram-line)' stroke-width='1.5' fill='none' marker-end='url(#ar)'></path><text x='272' y='299' fill='var(--cf-text)' font-size='12.5' text-anchor='middle'>cancel: reason, where scope went</text><path d='M885,208 L885,356 L60,356 L60,210' stroke='var(--cf-diagram-line)' stroke-width='1.5' fill='none' marker-end='url(#ar)'></path><text x='470' y='350' fill='var(--cf-text)' font-size='12.5' text-anchor='middle'>reopen: with a reason; the old acceptance is marked superseded</text></svg></figure>"
    }
